#X text 20 20 A cnv label is a SINGLE symbol \, so L 43 has to become one atom before it can be drawn. list fromsymbol gives character codes and list tosymbol turns codes back into a symbol -- the only way vanilla Pd builds a symbol whose length it does not know in advance., f 58;
