#X obj 20 740 outlet;
#X text 20 800 61 is = and 45 is -. list prepend puts its RIGHT inlet first \, and the accumulator lives there -- so each pass APPENDS. Clear \, run the n equals \, then the 21-n dashes. Running them the other way round gives a bar that fills from the right \, which is what the first version did., f 58;
