#X text 20 20 Mirrors mother.pd's audioIO subpatch \, so that "it sounds right on the Mac" means something. mother publishes the inputs on inL / inR and collects the output from outL / outR. Nothing makes a sound until DSP is on AND a generator is picked -- both off at load \, on purpose., f 58;
#X obj 20 130 r \$0-dsp;
