#X text 20 920 vol is a SQUARE law with 5 Hz smoothing \, exactly as mother.pd does it. Without the smoothing the knob zippers., f 58;
#X text 20 1000 THIS SECTION IS WHY THE STUB MUST NEVER LOAD ON THE DEVICE. s~ inL and catch~ outL/outR are names mother.pd already defines \, so a second definition is a load error \, not a duplicate value. Two tone frequencies so the channels are distinguishable by ear as well as by number., f 58;
