#X text 20 20 aux \, enc and encbut are all momentary 1/0 \, read out of Organelle_UI/main.cpp. The encoder is NOT plus/minus 1: it sends 1 for up and 0 for down. mother only forwards enc and encbut once the patch has asked with /enableEncoder., f 58;
