#X text 20 300 The panel's enc+ and enc- are two bangs rather than one toggle \, because a toggle would alternate direction on every click -- which is not what an encoder does., f 58;
#X text 20 420 aux \, encbut and the four knobs need nothing here: their iemguis send straight to the mother.pd names with no wire at all. See ref/conventions.md \, GUI binding., f 58;
